{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2024-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1722470400, "end_date": 1723075199, "month_true_total": 2328, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 19:06:40 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "171649043", "author": {"steamid": "76561197968137980", "personaname": "Comburo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/comburo/", "num_games_owned": 615, "num_reviews": 45, "playtime_forever": 29328, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 54, "playtime_at_review": 5857, "last_played": 1788725282, "avatar": "db0d64f6e1f1906e278295079deeb83866f02979"}, "language": "english", "review": "Tried it in 2015, played it for a few days, didn't get it.\nTried it again in 2018, played it for a few days until the mobs became too hard for me to kill. I didn't get it and stopped playing.\nTried again in 2021, got hyped after some trailers. Still didn't get it and stopped playing.\nPlayed The First Descendant in 2024. It takes a lot of inspiration from Warframe. For some reason, I understood the systems. And then the game-play for Warframe \"clicked\" for me. I stopped playing The First Descendant and came back to Warframe. And this time I get it. And I'm having the time of my life.\nBest part so far is that there is always something to do. Always goals to work towards. Got blueprints, need mats, need creds. Need to clear the star-chart, need to play all the missions available to me. So much fun 😊", "timestamp_created": 1723074692, "timestamp_updated": 1723074692, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171647712", "author": {"steamid": "76561198368058125", "personaname": "Hazza", "persona_status": "offlin